# The account pages' Supabase project and Cloudflare Turnstile widget
# (/sign-in/, /productions/). All three are public by design: the anon key
# is the role every grant and policy refuses, and a site key only names the
# widget. Never put a secret here; anything VITE_ ends up in the page.
# One file for `yarn dev` and `yarn build` alike, so the deploy needs no
# secrets of its own. A .env.local beside it overrides it on one machine.
# The hosted dev project, dlkehqragvyreyyxafnf, until production has its own.
# The pages themselves are built only with VITE_ACCOUNT_PAGES=on, which
# .env.development sets for `yarn dev` and nothing sets for the deploy
# (vite.config.ts, src/account/pages.ts).
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://dlkehqragvyreyyxafnf.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6ImRsa2VocXJhZ3Z5cmV5eXhhZm5mIiwicm9sZSI6ImFub24iLCJpYXQiOjE3Njg0MDc5MDIsImV4cCI6MjA4Mzk4MzkwMn0.muavEBAaJvrbXqYsCoflyIzdTjPcwZb46r39CBwAZkc
